WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.946
Hi! How does a tiny green bean grow into a plant? Today we'll look at the life cycle of a plant.

2
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:12.090
The life cycle starts with a seed.

3
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.962
When a seed germinates, the root grows first, then the shoot and leaves.

4
00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:21.066
The seedling grows bigger and becomes an adult plant.

5
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:28.314
The adult plant flowers and makes fruits with new seeds, and the life cycle begins again.

6
00:00:28.464 --> 00:00:31.386
A seed needs water to germinate.

7
00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:33.858
It also needs air.

8
00:00:34.008 --> 00:00:36.522
And it needs suitable warmth.

9
00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:43.842
A seed doesn't need light to germinate, but once leaves grow, the plant needs light to make food.

10
00:00:43.992 --> 00:00:50.154
Watch out! Many pupils think seeds need light to germinate. That's wrong!

11
00:00:50.304 --> 00:00:55.770
Green beans in a dark cupboard will still germinate if they have water, air and warmth.

12
00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:00.858
Once leaves grow, the plant needs light to make food.

13
00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:09.738
Your turn! When a seed germinates, what grows first? Pause and think.

14
00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:14.850
The root grows first. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.994
Another one! What three things does a seed need to germinate? Pause and think.

16
00:01:24.144 --> 00:01:29.922
Water, air and suitable warmth. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:30.072 --> 00:01:38.946
Here's another! Will a seed on dry cotton wool germinate? Pause and think.

18
00:01:39.096 --> 00:01:44.442
No, because it has no water. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:44.592 --> 00:01:53.106
Try one more! What does a plant do once it's an adult? Pause and think.

20
00:01:53.256 --> 00:01:59.370
It flowers and makes fruits with new seeds. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:09.210
Try one more! What is the right order of seedling, seed and adult plant? Pause and think.

22
00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.850
Seed, seedling, adult plant. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:23.370
Try one more! Do seeds need light to germinate? Pause and think.

24
00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:31.986
Germination doesn't need light. It needs water, air and the right temperature. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:32.136 --> 00:02:41.634
Last one! When a seedling first grows, where does its food come from? Pause and think.

26
00:02:41.784 --> 00:02:47.898
The seed leaves store food for the young plant. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:48.048 --> 00:02:58.626
Remember: a plant's life cycle goes seed, seedling, adult plant, and the adult makes new seeds. Germination needs water, air and suitable warmth.

28
00:02:58.776 --> 00:03:04.962
Plant some green beans on damp cotton wool and watch them change each day!

